# ESRF Example 5 iron -- +x/+z quarter for the IMA (image='+x-z') route.
#
# The caller plays example5_iron.jou first (full CAD), then this file.
# Clipping happens on the ACIS solid, so the quarter keeps the exact
# planar-faced chamfer of the full model.
webcut volume all with plane xplane offset 0
webcut volume all with plane zplane offset 0
delete volume with x_coord < 0
delete volume with z_coord < 0
